{
"k": "3121",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Clearly, that's not true, what with the selfishness with the bourbon."
},
{
"k": "3122",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "But no, hate's the wrong word. They fear you more than anything. You ate a lot of people back in your day."
},
{
"k": "3123",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Look, I'm not saying it's fair... but it's real.  People are scared of you."
},
{
"k": "3124",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I mean, look at your face."
},
{
"k": "3125",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I mean, look at your hands."
},
{
"k": "3126",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Okay, sure.  Silent treatment. I can do the same."
},
{
"k": "3127",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Awesome. Great example."
},
{
"k": "3128",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Where is she from?"
},
{
"k": "3129",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "That's what I thought."
},
{
"k": "3130",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Life is easier with friends, Bigby, and we live a long fuckin' time."
},
{
"k": "3131",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I know you like this whole Lone Wolf thing you got going for yourself, but I've seen the way you look at Snow, okay? You're not foolin' me."
},
{
"k": "3132",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Yup. Like I said."
},
{
"k": "3133",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Snow White. The girl that you've been pining for ever since-- oh you're fucking with me. Hilarious."
},
{
"k": "3134",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "How would anyone know? I answered the phone. You know how hard it was to get it back on the hook."
},
{
"k": "3135",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "She called earlier."
},
{
"k": "3136",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "The fresh air and sunshine pitch they sell you on is bullshit. I didn't escape out of the Homelands to end up in some prison.  Don't send me back there, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "3137",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "This has to stop. You can't keep sneaking off The Farm like this."
},
{
"k": "3138",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You're just gonna stand there holdin' it? Great."
},
{
"k": "3139",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Well, you can't change people's memories either."
},
{
"k": "3140",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Who'd you get in a fight with? A Fable, right? I'm sure you're not going around punching Mundy's."
},
{
"k": "3141",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Don't shoot the messenger... or eat the messenger. Whatever it is you do."
},
{
"k": "3142",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "[mirthless laugh] Fuck you."
},
{
"k": "3143",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "[deadpan] Your job is to beat the shit out of Fables."
},
{
"k": "3144",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Mister Toad?  You just told me you threatened to send him back to the Farm!"
},
{
"k": "3145",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Mister Toad? Okay. How're his kids doing?"
},
{
"k": "3146",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I get the impression you say that a lot."
},
{
"k": "3147",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Alright, sure."
},
{
"k": "3148",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "(making fun of him) \"By being big, and being baaaad.\" Don't say that shit in front of people."
},
{
"k": "3149",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "This is your problem. You can't have a normal relationship with anyone cause all this bullshit you're carrying around."
},
{
"k": "3150",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I don't know. How?"
},
{
"k": "3151",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "I'm sure you were shitty to everyone you came across tonight."
},
{
"k": "3152",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Sounds about right."
},
{
"k": "3153",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "She's here."
},
{
"k": "3154",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Right before you walked in."
},
{
"k": "3155",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Really?"
},
{
"k": "3156",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Name one."
},
{
"k": "3157",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Only to see you take it back off the second you walk--"
},
{
"k": "3158",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Do me a favor... stay quiet."
},
{
"k": "3159",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Yeah.  I wouldn't wanna be a pain in the ass..."
},
{
"k": "3160",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Yeah, yeah, alright... [emphasis] probably."
},
{
"k": "3161",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "See? You don't send me to the Farm, I stay quiet to keep you outta trouble. That's why it pays to be nice to people."
},
{
"k": "3162",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Oooooh. This is too dramatic..."
},
{
"k": "3163",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You're not people. That's the problem."
},
{
"k": "3164",
"who": "COLIN",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "You're the problem."
},
{
"k": "3165",
"who": "COLIN",
