"ctx": "Fables101/env_bigbyapartment",
"en": "Hey, it's Brian Summers for Stars. Hell was that? Yeah well maybe if you had more that one seat in this shitbox you wouldn't have to go around kickin people would ya? Hey you got a smoke? Thanks. You know, couple thousand more of these and we'll be even on that house you owe me. Aw come on, I can't deal with that fesh air bullshit and sunshine that they sell down there. The city Bigby! That's what calls to me. I wanna smell the streets, feel the steam come out of the manhole covers, get chased through central park by hobos and lunatics! Is that too much to ask? This is where I beloong, its home for me. Blind eye? How about just not being a jerk? You know uh, the house didn't blow itself down, Bigby. That's all I'm sayin'. Do with that, what you will. I'm not saying it's reason enough for me to have definitely been offered a drink, but... it would have helped ease some of the pain you once caused me, yes. It would also show everyone how different you are now. You know, I take it all back, this is why everyone hates you. That and all the murdering you used to do. Nah, I'm just giving you shit. Well, clearly thats not true, what with all the selfishness with all the burben an all of that? ut no, hate's the wrong word. They are more scared of you more than anything. You ate a lot of people back in your day. Yeah and things like that don't help matters. That far off look like that when you think about the old days. Don't smile when you do that, makes people uncomfortable."
